    <briefdescription>
<para>Singapore calendars </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Holidays for the <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_singapore" kindref="compound">Singapore</ref> exchange (data from <ulink url="http://www.simex.com.sg">http://www.simex.com.sg</ulink>): <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Saturdays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Sundays </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>New Year&apos;s day, January 1st </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Good Friday </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Labour Day, May 1st </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>National Day, August 9th </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Christmas, December 25th  </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para><para>Other holidays for which no rule is given (data available for 2004-2010 only:) <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Chinese New Year </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Hari Raya Haji </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Vesak Poya Day </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Deepavali </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Diwali </para></listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Hari Raya Puasa </para></listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
